    title: "rust: a fully-qualified call through a third-party crate with no use statement (serde_json::from_str, tokio::fs::read) keeps its whole path in the name slot; splitting needs the manifest's dependency names"  # 9eb4
    status: todo_hard  # 9eb4
    priority: 3  # 9eb4
    parent:  # 9eb4
